    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n83707" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πλεονέκτ-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>advantage, gain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Lg.</u>
				709c
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				D.
				5.23
			</span></i> (pl.), <i><span class="en">
				18.60
			</span></i>, etc.: pl., <i>gains, successes,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gorg.
				<u>Pal.</u>
				30
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν τοῖς πολέμοις</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					X.
					<u>Eq.Mag.</u>
					5.11
				</span></i>
			; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ τοῦ στρατηγοῦντος π.</span>
				Chor.<i><span class="en">
				p.35
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>; <i>advantages</i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>SIG</u>
				888.133
			</span></i> (Scaptopara, <span class="entity">iii A. D.</span>); <i>excellences,
				virtues,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Zos.
				4.54
			</span></i>: so in sg., <i>superiority, superior quality,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς αἰτίας</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Diog.Oen.
					39
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῆς φωνῆς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Eun.
					<u>Hist.</u>
					p.246
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">π. σωματικά</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Jul.
					<u>Or.</u>
					6.194c
				</span></i>
			, cf. Chor.<i><span class="en">
				p.209
			</span></i>
			<i><span class="en">
				B.
			</span></i>: metaph., 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ κατ᾽ εὐθεῖαν ἐκ τῶν ἐναντίων π.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Dam.
					<u>Pr.</u>
					350
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>act of overreaching, undue gain,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
				21.60
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				50.38
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Ep.</u>
				5.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Arist.
				<u>Pol.</u>
				1311a5
			</span></i>; =
			<i>vitium,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Gloss.
			</span></i></div>
